<section id="about" class="about container" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <p class="section-label about__label">
    <span aria-hidden="true">04 / </span>about
  </p>

  <h2 id="about-heading" class="visually-hidden">About</h2>

  <div class="about__body">
    <p>
      I'm finishing a software engineering degree at UQ. Before that I spent
      five years in professional kitchens, where you learn fast which parts of
      a system hold up during a busy service and which don't. I still look at
      businesses that way.
    </p>

    <p>
      I split my time between Brisbane and Queenstown. I also run
      <a href="https://marriottsystems.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Marriott Systems</a>,
      where I make my own software products.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .about__label {
    color: var(--color-accent-muted);
  }

  .about__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 58ch;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-prose);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about__body p {
    max-width: none;
  }

  .about__emphasis {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: var(--color-accent-bg);
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    box-decoration-break: clone;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .about__body {
      padding-left: clamp(0rem, -2rem + 10vw, 8rem);
    }
  }
</style>
